# Whole numbers of any size (up to 6,400 bits) in memory, with exact arithmetic: set, copy,
# compare, add, subtract, multiply by a small factor or a power of ten, and shift. Floating-point
# text is computed with them, exactly (D-125).
#
# This module is generated from tools/bignum.dsl by tools/build.py.

bignum is module
bignum purpose "Whole numbers of any size up to 6,400 bits, in memory, with exact arithmetic: what floating-point text is computed with (D-125)"
bignum path bignum
bignum imports standard.machine
bignum imports standard.system
bignum imports standard.string
bignum imports standard.math
bignum imports standard.compare
bignum imports standard.bits
bignum imports standard.logic
bignum imports standard.test
bignum imports frames
bignum exports setSmall
